          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ber wan ocam kun obedo kede yomyic, pien ominni rik oto oko, aman doŋ kwo; nwaŋ orwenyo, doŋ onwoŋere.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
